	// such as an emoji: rich icons and content are the markup form's),
	// {"divider":true} ("-" works too), a group heading {"group":"Move to"}
	// (the items after it, up to the next heading or divider, are its group),
	// or a submenu {label, children:[...]} nested up to 5 levels deep. An item
	// with href is a link the browser follows (no sb-select). Server data: a
	// new array replaces the whole tree, open or not. Attribute items, as
